{"id":"vod_zy360_81500","vodId":"81500","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"充满挑战的人生","name_cn":"充满挑战的人生","date":"2025-01-01","year":"2025","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20251002-1/0f13e13975d80717daaa284c2dc06174.jpg"},"summary":"22岁的软件开发者萨姆·杨自幼便是狂热的游戏爱好者。学生时代全身心投入游戏开发，终于推出了酝酿已久的冒险解谜游戏《Luminate》！然而，当超人气游戏主播马歇尔·劳给出恶评后，她作为游戏开发者的前途骤然黯淡。更意外的是——马歇尔竟搬到了她隔壁！随着与马歇尔的相遇，萨姆与公司上司查尔斯·琼斯、发小兼常去咖啡馆的员工林肯·哈德森等人的关系也逐渐发生变化。在父母过度保护下长大、恋爱经验为零的萨姆，面对与男性突如其来的亲密接触不知所措，却也开始慢慢打破心防。这场以人生为赌注的终极挑战——萨姆能否成功通关！？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"喜剧,爱情,动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-12-18 11:36:23","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20251002/zPHm6SnE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20251009/muCM15GS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20251016/2fjVsrh1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20251023/fjZhFrUd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20251030/8PZgy5tP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20251106/U5A7YiGB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20251113/isu9FHvl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20251120/XlSPGdYW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20251127/frqtNT2L/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20251204/MEGaKuTo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20251211/IOSjFnol/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20251218/0hnICiHZ/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:16.378Z"}